# Dynamic (splat/placeholder) rules go last. Cloudflare counts every rule after
# the first dynamic one as dynamic, and caps dynamic rules at 100, so a splat
# near the top fails the deploy once enough static rules follow it. The
# front-matter redirects appended at build land after this one, so keep that
# block small or move this rule. script/validate-redirects enforces the limit.
